### BOOKINGS

## Get booking details
GET {{host}}/v1/bookings/8f730a06-a0c0-400f-ab77-1d5f4df0d3c9
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Account Bookings
GET {{host}}/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Account Bookings (ordered by checkout)
GET {{host}}/v1/bookings?sort=to,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Account Bookings (ordered by checkout)
GET {{host}}/v1/bookings?checkin_from=2025-09-01&checkin_to=2025-09-02&sort=to,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Single Property Bookings
GET {{host}}/v1/properties/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create booking
POST {{host}}/v1/properties/fe6726ed-d05e-4990-9817-9a9244b9c650/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from": "2026-03-01",
  "to": "2026-03-02",
  "channel": "airbnb",
  "channel_id": "testhttp1"
}

